      <text x="60" y="325" fill="#1e293b" font-size="11" font-weight="600">3. End-to-End Correctness (Is final answer right?)</text>
      <text x="70" y="343" fill="#7A756B" font-size="9">Metrics: Exact match, F1, human evaluation, fact verification</text>
      <text x="70" y="360" fill="#7A756B" font-size="9">Depends on: entire pipeline working together seamlessly</text>
