      <li>Multi-stage ranking reduces latency overhead while improving quality dramatically</li>
      <li>Adaptive routing reduces cost by matching strategy to query difficulty</li>
      <li>Iterative refinement enables complex reasoning across multiple documents</li>
      <li>Advanced patterns trade implementation complexity for significantly better quality</li>
